msgid ":mod:`!asyncore` --- Asynchronous socket handler"
msgstr ":mod:`!asyncore` --- Penangan soket asinkron"

msgid ""
"This module is no longer part of the Python standard library. It "
"was :ref:`removed in Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed>` after being "
"deprecated in Python 3.6.  The removal was decided in :pep:`594`."
msgstr ""
"Modul ini bukan lagi bagian dari pustaka standar Python. Modul "
"ini :ref:`dihapus pada Python 3.12 <whatsnew312-removed>` setelah dinyatakan "
"usang pada Python 3.6. Penghapusan ini ditetapkan dalam :pep:`594`."

msgid "Applications should use the :mod:`asyncio` module instead."
msgstr "Aplikasi sebaiknya menggunakan modul :mod:`asyncio`."

msgid ""
"The last version of Python that provided the :mod:`!asyncore` module was "
"`Python 3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/asyncore.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"Versi terakhir Python yang menyediakan modul :mod:`!asyncore` adalah `Python "
"3.11 <https://docs.python.org/3.11/library/asyncore.html>`_."
